:"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0239","start":239,"end":242,"surface":"周公旦","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0253","start":253,"end":256,"surface":"周公旦","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0263","start":263,"end":266,"surface":"言之者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者或未定指代保留原文；不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0268","start":268,"end":271,"surface":"周公旦","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0287","start":287,"end":288,"surface":"恬","kind":"person","person_id":"k2p_5ol_dwh_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0316","start":316,"end":318,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0326","start":326,"end":327,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"pim_eqs_362","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0328","start":328,"end":331,"surface":"關龍逢","kind":"person","person_id":"iml_mgn_ycw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0332","start":332,"end":333,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"r2g_xfm_3ml","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0334","start":334,"end":338,"surface":"王子比干","kind":"person","person_id":"fmd_j09_ef0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0402","start":402,"end":404,"surface":"使者","kind":"person","person_id":"c9n_rjf_cwd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0428","start":428,"end":430,"surface":"蒙恬","kind":"person","person_id":"k2p_5ol_dwh_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0457","start":457,"end":458,"surface":"恬","kind":"person","person_id":"k2p_5ol_dwh_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian:m010-0491","start":491,"end":492,"surface":"恬","kind":"person","person_id":"k2p_5ol_dwh_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-088-mengtian","book_id":"b-shiji-088","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-088-mengtian"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p017","text":"元王曰：「不然。寡人聞之，諫者福也，諛者賊也。人主聽諛，是愚惑也。雖然，禍不妄至，福不徒來。天地合氣，以生百財。陰陽有分，不離四時，十有二月，日至為期。聖人徹焉，身乃無災。明王用之，人莫敢欺。故云福之至也，人自生之；禍之至也，人自成之。禍與福同，刑與德雙。聖人察之，以知吉凶。桀紂之時，與天爭功，擁遏鬼神，使不得通。是固已無道矣，諛臣有眾。桀有諛臣，名曰趙梁。教為無道，勸以貪狼。繋湯夏臺，殺關龍逢。左右恐死，偷諛於傍。國危於累卵，皆曰無傷。稱樂萬歲，或曰未央。蔽其耳目，與之詐狂。湯卒伐桀，身死國亡。聽其諛臣，身獨受殃。春秋著之，至今不忘。紂有諛臣，名為左彊。誇而目巧，教為象郎。將至於天，又有玉床。犀玉之器，象箸而羹。聖人剖其心，壯士斬其胻。箕子恐死，被髪佯狂。殺周太子歷，囚文王昌。投之石室，將以昔至明。陰兢活之，與之俱亡。入於周地，得太公望。興卒聚兵，與紂相攻。文王病死，載尸以行。太子發代將，號為武王。戰於牧野，破之華山之陽。紂不勝敗而還走，圍之象郎。自殺宣室，身死不葬。頭懸車軫，四馬曳行。寡人念其如此，腸如涫湯。是人皆富有天下而貴至天子，然而大傲。欲無猒時，舉事而喜高，貪很而驕。不用忠信，聽其諛臣，而為天下笑。今寡人之邦，居諸侯之閒，曾不如秋毫。舉事不當，又安亡逃！」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m017-0138","start":138,"end":139,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m017-0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m017-0170","start":170,"end":171,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m017-0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"趙梁","kind":"person","person_id":"lih_9tv_8hf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m017-0191","start":191,"end":192,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m